              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#f59e0b"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="review-item-text">The clarity and natural vivid olive tone on this untreated peridot is exceptional! Swastic Exports provided rapid express dispatch and the GIA laboratory certification was fully authenticated. Outstanding natural stones!</p>
            <div class="review-purchased-badge">
              <img src="{{ 'product-gem-green-beryl.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Lime Green Natural Peridot" class="purchased-thumb">
              <span class="purchased-title">Lime Green Natural Peridot 4.44ct - Untreated Cushion</span>
              <div class="purchased-stars">★★★★★</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

