            <p class="review-item-text">Wow, this Royal Blue Ceylon sapphire is breathtaking in person! The optical brilliance under sunlight reveals velvety cornflower depths with zero heat treatment. Swastic Exports' gemology team was very patient and helpful throughout selection. Thanks so much!</p>
            <div class="review-purchased-badge">
              <img src="{{ 'product-gem-aquamarine.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Natural Ceylon Royal Blue Sapphire" class="purchased-thumb">
